---
import {  Mail, Phone, MapPin } from 'lucide-react';
---

<footer class="bg-slate-950 text-[#E8CFC8] relative z-10 overflow-hidden">
  {/* Calligraphy Watermark */}
  <div class="absolute bottom-[-60px] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 font-arabic text-[150px] sm:text-[260px] leading-none text-white/[0.03] whitespace-nowrap pointer-events-none select-none">
    مُرَاجَعَة
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 pt-20 pb-12 relative z-10">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 pb-12 border-b border-white/10">
      {/* Brand Col */}
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-4">
        <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-3 group">
          <img 
            src="/Logo.png" 
            alt="Murojaah.id" 
            class="h-12 w-auto object-contain transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105" 
          />
        </a>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#E8CFC8]/70 max-w-sm leading-relaxed mt-4">
          Platform ekosistem Al-Qur'an terpadu di Indonesia — memadukan metode tikrar klasik, komunitas kajian, penerbitan mushaf premium, hingga perjalanan ibrah bersama.
        </p>

        <div class="font-arabic text-lg text-amber-500 leading-relaxed pt-2">
          اقْرَأُوا الْقُرْآنَ فَإِنَّهُ يَأْتِي يَوْمَ الْقِيَامَةِ شَفِيعًا لأَصْحَابِهِ
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#E8CFC8]/50 italic">
          "Bacalah Al-Qur'an, karena sesungguhnya ia akan datang pada hari kiamat sebagai pemberi syafaat bagi para pembacanya." (HR. Muslim)
        </p>

        
      </div>

      {/* Quick Links */}
      <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-4">
        <h5 class="text-white text-xs font-extrabold tracking-widest uppercase">Program</h5>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs text-[#E8CFC8]/70">
          <li>
            <a href="/kegiatan?tab=sedang-berjalan" class="hover:text-amber-500 transition-colors">
              Halaqah Subuh
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/kegiatan?tab=sedang-berjalan" class="hover:text-amber-500 transition-colors">
              Dauroh 30 Hari
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/kegiatan?tab=event-rutinan" class="hover:text-amber-500 transition-colors">
              Kajian Hadits Shahih
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/kegiatan?tab=event-rutinan" class="hover:text-amber-500 transition-colors">
              Umroh Bareng Huffadz
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      {/* Toko & Literasi */}
      <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-4">
        <h5 class="text-white text-xs font-extrabold tracking-widest uppercase">Literasi</h5>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs text-[#E8CFC8]/70">
          <li>
            <a href="/toko?cat=MUSHAF+STANDAR" class="hover:text-amber-500 transition-colors">
              Mushaf Huffadz
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/toko?cat=KITAB+HADITS" class="hover:text-amber-500 transition-colors">
              Kitab Shahih Bukhari
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/toko?cat=EBOOK+DIGITAL" class="hover:text-amber-500 transition-colors">
              Ebook Tikrar 20x
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/blog" class="hover:text-amber-500 transition-colors">
              Artikel Murojaah
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      {/* Contact Info */}
      <div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-4">
        <h5 class="text-white text-xs font-extrabold tracking-widest uppercase">Kontak Admin</h5>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs text-[#E8CFC8]/70">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
            <Phone className="w-4 h-4 text-amber-500 shrink-0" />
            <span>+62 812-3456-7890 (WA Admin)</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
            <Mail className="w-4 h-4 text-amber-500 shrink-0" />
            <span>salam@murojaah.id</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <MapPin className="w-4 h-4 text-amber-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
            <span>Jakarta Selatan, DKI Jakarta, Indonesia</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Bottom Bar */}
    <div class="pt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-[#E8CFC8]/50">
      <p>© 2026 Murojaah.id. Wadah Para Hafizh Qur'an Indonesia. All rights reserved.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-amber-500 transition-colors">
          Kebijakan Privasi
        </a>
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-amber-500 transition-colors">
          Syarat & Ketentuan
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
